(6391655, 947028, 131448, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s going on here.... oh that blur is ice cream. She dropped it... oh I see. Higher shutter speed would have made it the ice cream focused and apart of the story. But mabey your were going for motion. But like I said when I first looked at it I thought the cone was in the distance and not apart of the subject. This is the longest comment I have ever left. Wow.</td>', 'Not sure what''s going on here.... oh that blur is ice cream. She dropped it... oh I see. Higher shutter speed would have made it the ice cream focused and apart of the story. But mabey your were going for motion. But like I said when I first looked at it I thought the cone was in the distance and not apart of the subject. This is the longest comment I have ever left. Wow.', '2011-04-20 19:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
