(6391848, 947139, 131377, '<td valign="top">CUTE! :)</td>', 'CUTE! :)', '2011-04-20 22:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6391849, 946966, 131377, '<td valign="top">It would have been way better if he didn''t look like he was smiling. But I imagine he was probably panting. You''re right though. Big cats don''t belong in cages.</td>', 'It would have been way better if he didn''t look like he was smiling. But I imagine he was probably panting. You''re right though. Big cats don''t belong in cages.', '2011-04-20 22:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
