(6392082, 947085, 103142, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and moody -- but I don''t see any sadness here. It''s a lovely photo, though. 5</td>', 'Beautiful and moody -- but I don''t see any sadness here. It''s a lovely photo, though. 5', '2011-04-21 08:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
