(6392798, 947059, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWW  This is poignant.  I wonder if seeing her/him from more straight on wouldn''t worked a bit better, as so much detail is in the concrete.  I do love the textures and edit though. 7</td>', 'AWW  This is poignant.  I wonder if seeing her/him from more straight on wouldn''t worked a bit better, as so much detail is in the concrete.  I do love the textures and edit though. 7', '2011-04-22 10:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
