(6395923, 946254, 70265, '<td valign="top">This made me stop &amp; ponder what the situation could be here ... Is that young girl being reprimanded by her father? Or has she been abducted by a stranger ? What are those scratches on the window &amp; how did they get there ? Your title adds to the mystery. Well done.</td>', 'This made me stop & ponder what the situation could be here ... Is that young girl being reprimanded by her father? Or has she been abducted by a stranger ? What are those scratches on the window & how did they get there ? Your title adds to the mystery. Well done.', '2011-04-26 16:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
