(6396144, 946985, 129091, '<td valign="top">Why this images works for me, I like the black and how it surrounds the figure.  Along with the posture of your subject help to portay emotion.  when I look at this I feel as though the figure is alone, and that is very sad.</td>', 'Why this images works for me, I like the black and how it surrounds the figure.  Along with the posture of your subject help to portay emotion.  when I look at this I feel as though the figure is alone, and that is very sad.', '2011-04-26 22:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
