(6396147, 947167, 129091, '<td valign="top">I like how this is zoomed in tight; however, I don''t necessarily feel sadness.  It comes across to me more like he has a headache.  Regardless, I like the detail in the image, and I realize that capturing sadness can be difficult.</td>', 'I like how this is zoomed in tight; however, I don''t necessarily feel sadness.  It comes across to me more like he has a headache.  Regardless, I like the detail in the image, and I realize that capturing sadness can be difficult.', '2011-04-26 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
