(6396877, 947143, 23484, '<td valign="top">What an outstanding shot.</td>', 'What an outstanding shot.', '2011-04-27 10:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6396929, 946544, 19825, '<td valign="top">Come on, this was the saddest picture of the lot. This deserved to have placed much higher than 15th. It is an awesome picture. I gave two pictures 8''s in this challenge -- yours and the one that won the blue. There were a lot of staged sadness pictures, but this one captures the true emotion. Great job.</td>', 'Come on, this was the saddest picture of the lot. This deserved to have placed much higher than 15th. It is an awesome picture. I gave two pictures 8''s in this challenge -- yours and the one that won the blue. There were a lot of staged sadness pictures, but this one captures the true emotion. Great job.', '2011-04-27 10:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6396939, 946254, 36843, '<td valign="top">Thought this would have done better, nice shot</td>', 'Thought this would have done better, nice shot', '2011-04-27 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6396941, 947154, 3936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Excellent image!  The lighting, the processing, the tones of this image all grab me.  I love the back story on this one, and the "free" smile at the end makes a great ending.<br/> <br/>This is exactly the type of image that is my favorite.  Plenty of detail, texture, and it is timeless...  I could look at this for hours and never tire.  Absolutely beautifu!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your win, it is very well deserved.</td>', 'Wow!  Excellent image!  The lighting, the processing, the tones of this image all grab me.  I love the back story on this one, and the "free" smile at the end makes a great ending. This is exactly the type of image that is my favorite.  Plenty of detail, texture, and it is timeless...  I could look at this for hours and never tire.  Absolutely beautifu! Congratulations on your win, it is very well deserved.', '2011-04-27 10:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6396954, 947012, 104230, '<td valign="top">Great capture, and to echo Dave, I love the tones and textures.</td>', 'Great capture, and to echo Dave, I love the tones and textures.', '2011-04-27 11:04:15.000000', NULL, 0),
