(6397025, 947154, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the story behind this one. :)  Reminds me of a guy in Barbados who said that for $10.00, he''d climb a tree and pick a coconut.  So, my dad handed him $10.00 and he climbed the tree and tossed the coconut down and said...."For $10.00 more....I''ll come down again."  My dad looked at him and replied..."Nah, that''s ok.  You can stay up there," and walked away. LOL</td>', 'Love the story behind this one. :)  Reminds me of a guy in Barbados who said that for $10.00, he''d climb a tree and pick a coconut.  So, my dad handed him $10.00 and he climbed the tree and tossed the coconut down and said...."For $10.00 more....I''ll come down again."  My dad looked at him and replied..."Nah, that''s ok.  You can stay up there," and walked away. LOL', '2011-04-27 12:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6397066, 947154, 112972, '<td valign="top">Big congratulations on your win, Valeriy!</td>', 'Big congratulations on your win, Valeriy!', '2011-04-27 13:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6397069, 946501, 112972, '<td valign="top">You are one of my favorite commenters on DPC.  Love reading what you have to say.  Oh and before I forget, congrats on your ribbon :)</td>', 'You are one of my favorite commenters on DPC.  Love reading what you have to say.  Oh and before I forget, congrats on your ribbon :)', '2011-04-27 13:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6397101, 947095, 112972, '<td valign="top">Actually this looks pretty convincing and I gave it an 8.  The only thing that looks <i>added</i> is the tear.  I wonder if some smeared makeup would have pushed it to another level or not.  Great work again!<br/> <br/>edit:  I take it back.  Makeup would not have worked here actually.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-27 14:14:53.</i></td>', 'Actually this looks pretty convincing and I gave it an 8.  The only thing that looks added is the tear.  I wonder if some smeared makeup would have pushed it to another level or not.  Great work again! edit:  I take it back.  Makeup would not have worked here actually.', '2011-04-27 13:38:58.000000', '2011-04-27 15:14:53.000000', 0),
(6397108, 946663, 20577, '<td valign="top">Please don''t be discouraged by your score and low placement. It has nothing to do with the quality of the photo, just the size. Had this been a larger image I think it would have easily been above 6. Keep up the good work and try to use a bigger picture next time!</td>', 'Please don''t be discouraged by your score and low placement. It has nothing to do with the quality of the photo, just the size. Had this been a larger image I think it would have easily been above 6. Keep up the good work and try to use a bigger picture next time!', '2011-04-27 13:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6397121, 947095, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and excellent expression.  You are doing well on both sides of the camera!</td>', 'Nice lighting and excellent expression.  You are doing well on both sides of the camera!', '2011-04-27 13:56:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6397130, 946893, 50641, '<td valign="top">Lovely hues.  I like your composition too - the bokeh is like a memory of old roses, inhabiting half the frame.  Wistful, the waiting to bloom again.</td>', 'Lovely hues.  I like your composition too - the bokeh is like a memory of old roses, inhabiting half the frame.  Wistful, the waiting to bloom again.', '2011-04-27 14:11:19.000000', NULL, 0),
