(6397996, 947070, 91783, '<td valign="top">this was a very tough challenge, with the voters that is. i think you did a good job and to me its real and tells a story. :) He could be thinking about food, a business (you nevver know), or his family. I like it a lot. should have placed higher...</td>', 'this was a very tough challenge, with the voters that is. i think you did a good job and to me its real and tells a story. :) He could be thinking about food, a business (you nevver know), or his family. I like it a lot. should have placed higher...', '2011-04-28 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 0),
