(6558908, 947130, 75713, '<td valign="top">Ohh he is so sad looking ... I just want to hug him. <br/></td>', 'Ohh he is so sad looking ... I just want to hug him. ', '2011-10-03 02:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6635947, 946986, 91783, '<td valign="top">this is a really great image. I''m still surprised it didn''t do better. top 10 atleast. When people have such different definitions for ''sadness'' its very hard to do well. there were a couple people who didn''t think my entry showed sadness at all. I feel it did though.<br/> <br/>This entry for me shows sadness. And its your own take on sadness. That''s what makes it yours and wonderful! This is sharp, colors are great! i was one of many who gave this a 6, but i wish i could have given it an 8. (btw i hope you got out of that score rut) =]</td>', 'this is a really great image. I''m still surprised it didn''t do better. top 10 atleast. When people have such different definitions for ''sadness'' its very hard to do well. there were a couple people who didn''t think my entry showed sadness at all. I feel it did though. This entry for me shows sadness. And its your own take on sadness. That''s what makes it yours and wonderful! This is sharp, colors are great! i was one of many who gave this a 6, but i wish i could have given it an 8. (btw i hope you got out of that score rut) =]', '2012-01-05 17:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6648676, 946963, 68504, '<td valign="top">ha! Nice series.  When is a Golden really sad?  In your pic, she looks long suffering and slightly pissed off, if only she knew the expression.  (Perfect segue to my poncey poodle shot).</td>', 'ha! Nice series.  When is a Golden really sad?  In your pic, she looks long suffering and slightly pissed off, if only she knew the expression.  (Perfect segue to my poncey poodle shot).', '2012-01-18 13:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7225536, 947143, 12076, '<td valign="top">Nice.  So underrated in that challenge.   Oozes sadness..  waiting for the call.  Dead leaves suggesting time passing.  The bright colors adding some confusion.  Great shot.</td>', 'Nice.  So underrated in that challenge.   Oozes sadness..  waiting for the call.  Dead leaves suggesting time passing.  The bright colors adding some confusion.  Great shot.', '2014-06-07 16:03:59.000000', NULL, 0);
